WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.203 --> 00:00:17.041
Baseball players wear uniforms at the stadium.

2
00:00:17.042 --> 00:00:31.795
The doctor wears a white coat at the hospital.

3
00:00:31.796 --> 00:00:48.236
The police officer wears a uniform on the street.

4
00:00:48.237 --> 00:01:04.539
We wear raincoats on rainy days.

5
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:20.180
Firefighters wear uniforms at the fire.

6
00:01:20.181 --> 00:01:36.461
Soldiers wear uniforms at the base.

7
00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:53.760
We wear warm jackets on cold days.

8
00:01:53.761 --> 00:02:16.365
Daddy wears a suit at the office.

9
00:02:16.366 --> 00:02:23.508
"Welcome home, Daddy!"

